<task id="001" project="spaarkeai-mcp-bff-api-r2">
  <metadata>
    <title>Remove the legacy agent from the BFF</title>
    <phase>0 Removal, prerequisites and seams</phase>
    <gate>startable</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Tags include bff-api and deletion; modifies and deletes .cs files and tests across the BFF, ArchTests and contract suites</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Cross-cutting removal touching 3+ existing consumers (filters, DI, auth comments, ledger, contract and seam tests) with a hidden live dependency (HandoffUrlBuilder in the chat create-record tool)</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>A</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Owns Api/Agent/**, AgentModule, Program.cs, EndpointMappingExtensions.cs, PlaybookAuthorizationFilter.cs, AiAuthorizationFilter.cs, AuthorizationModule.cs comments and the agent ledger rows; no other Phase 0 Wave 1 task edits these files</parallel-reason>
    <deps>none</deps>
    <tags>bff-api, refactoring, deletion, testing, auth</tags>
    <estimated-effort>4-6 hours</estimated-effort>
  </metadata>

  <prompt>Delete the legacy M365 Copilot agent gateway from the BFF: Api/Agent/**, AgentModule, AgentTokenOptions, their Program.cs and EndpointMappingExtensions registrations, their tests, route-guard ledger rows and /api/agent/* contract tests. First remove PlaybookAuthorizationFilter's dependency on AgentEndpoints (its agent-only branch and the two constants it uses), and relocate HandoffUrlBuilder (still used by the chat create-record tool) out of Api/Agent/ with its own registration. Measure the publish-size delta.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Follow ADRs strictly. Expert in ASP.NET Core Minimal API module DI, the route-guard ArchTests and safe large deletions.</role>
  <goal>No /api/agent/* route, Agent* service, AgentModule or AgentTokenOptions remains in the BFF; HandoffUrlBuilder lives outside Api/Agent/ and DataverseCreateRecordHandler still resolves it; the BFF builds with 0 warnings; ArchTests, unit, contract and seam suites pass; the publish-size delta is recorded.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Spec FR-01 (Phase 0's first task; owner 2026-11-25: remove now, no parallel period). Inventory: notes/legacy-agent-inventory-2026-11-25.md; blast radius: notes/reuse-scan.md "Legacy removal blast radius (FR-01)". The pre-removal tree is commit 37f0864afe; tasks 020, 024 and 030 read the deleted start/poll and de-duplication code from there. Closes #2575; records the decision on #1523 (AgentTokenService).</background>
