  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">PlaybookAuthorizationFilter.AuthorizeRunAsync (:560-610) has an agent branch keyed on AgentPlaybookRequest (:569-588) that is the only user of AgentEndpoints.PlaybookIdRequiredDetail / DocumentIdRequiredDetail. Remove that branch with the agent route and update the fail-closed log text at :605; the execute branch (ExecutePlaybookRequest, PlaybookRunEndpoints.DocumentIdsRequiredMessage) and every other mode stay byte-for-byte unchanged. If grep shows any non-agent caller of the two constants, move them (identical values) into Api/Filters/ before deleting AgentEndpoints instead.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">HandoffUrlBuilder is relocated, not deleted: move it to Services/Ai/Handoff/HandoffUrlBuilder.cs (namespace Sprk.Bff.Api.Services.Ai.Handoff), keep every public method unchanged, and register it as a singleton with the same Dataverse URL fallback (AgentModule.cs:45-49) in the existing module that registers the AI chat tool handlers (AiModule.cs or AiChatModule.cs; grep to confirm). Do not add a new module.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Leave every file under src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Mcp/** untouched (spaarkeai-mcp-bff-api-r1 owns it until PR #3161 merges). The comment at Api/Mcp/LegalOperations/Decisions/DecisionsTextSummary.cs:11 is cleared by task 020; record it in the task notes as the one known remaining grep hit.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Do not edit PlaybookOrchestrationService.cs (task 005 owns it), EventEndpoints.cs (006), FinanceAuthorizationFilter.cs or Api/Finance/** (008); comment-only edits in IPlaybookOrchestrationService.cs and PlaybookParameterPolicy.cs are this task's.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-008">Every ledger row removed from RouteAuthorizationGuardTests.Ledger.cs is for a route under /api/agent/*; no other route's ledger row, PermanentBasis or SweepFinding changes. Remove ProvenByTest cases for /api/agent/* only; if a ProvenByTest case uses /api/agent/* as a stand-in for a generic rule, replace the route with an existing route of the same shape instead of deleting the proof.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028">Delete AgentTokenService and AgentTokenOptions without changing any other credential path: OrderedCredentialClientProvider, IdentityConfigurationValidator, DataverseUserClient and AuthorizationModule keep their runtime behaviour; only agent-specific comments, options and validator branches are removed. Any change beyond comments in AuthorizationModule.cs is out of scope: escalate.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">Tests are deleted only when they test removed /api/agent/* behaviour; a test that proves a still-live rule through an agent route is rewritten against a live route in the same PR (KEEP-path tests are never deleted without same-PR replacement). No Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt; or Mock&lt;IServiceClient&gt;.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-029">Every change this task makes under src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/ is listed in the PR with a Placement Justification that cites .claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md (source: spec.md 'Placement &amp; New Components'), and the PR records the publish-size delta against a fresh master build per .claude/constraints/azure-deployment.md 'BFF Publish-Size Per-Task Verification Rule' (expected negative): +5 MB or more needs explicit justification, 55 MB total triggers architecture review, 60 MB is a hard stop. No new HIGH CVE (dotnet list package --vulnerable --include-transitive).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Before each push run bash scripts/quality/check-changed-cs-format.sh origin/master and /conflict-check (route-guard ledger files may overlap r1 PR #3161 and Word add-in PR #3157). CS0618 is a build error: migrate, never suppress. If Directory.Build.props:28's AgentEndpoints suppression note becomes dead, remove it.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">The PR description includes "Closes #2575". Draft the #1523 decision comment (AgentTokenService removed with the agent) in projects/spaarkeai-mcp-bff-api-r2/notes/001-issue-comments.md for the main session to post; do not post it.</constraint>
  </constraints>

